{"id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-category.md","title":"稠密开集、comeager 与 meager","display":"df-category — 稠密开集、comeager 与 meager","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-category","aliases":["20-df-category"],"display":"df-category — 稠密开集、comeager 与 meager","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 14.1.1；Exercise 14.1.6","source_pdf_pages":[240,241,242],"source_printed_pages":[211,212,213],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-category — 稠密开集、comeager 与 meager"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 14.1.1；Exercise 14.1.6"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>240</span><span>241</span><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,U\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A,U\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；下列谓词均由 Assertion 引入。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Dense}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [U\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\\n[(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Open}(U_n)\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(U_n))\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Meager}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(2^\\omega\\setminus A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NowhereDense}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land A\\cap[\\tau]=\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FirstCategory}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(A_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\\n[A=\\bigcup_n A_n\\land\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{NowhereDense}(A_n)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Dense}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [U\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\\n[(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Open}(U_n)\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(U_n))\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Meager}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(2^\\omega\\setminus A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NowhereDense}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land A\\cap[\\tau]=\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FirstCategory}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(A_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\\n[A=\\bigcup_n A_n\\land\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{NowhereDense}(A_n)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这些是 Cantor 空间中的集合论性质，没有有效性前提。NowhereDense 允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 非闭；其量词表达每个柱有一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不交的子柱，等价于闭包无内部。FirstCategory 与 Meager 的等价另由范畴性质原子证明，避免自然语言在定义处承担这个等价证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 14.1.1、Exercise 14.1.6；印刷 211–213 / PDF 240–242。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,U\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Dense}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [U\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(U_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\\n[(\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{Open}(U_n)\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(U_n))\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Meager}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Comeager}(2^\\omega\\setminus A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NowhereDense}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ \\exists\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land A\\cap[\\tau]=\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FirstCategory}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(A_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\\n[A=\\bigcup_n A_n\\land\\forall n\\ \\operatorname{NowhereDense}(A_n)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1829,"backlinks":[{"id":"60e50068702b03cb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]。"},{"id":"088f0b71a9b22ef9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]。"},{"id":"677e7c9793466351","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-category-laws]]。"},{"id":"249ce19d50d1f381","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"c989c60a7c30291e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]。"},{"id":"a8485bd5a48a9fe0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]；see [[20-df-closure-tree]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"}],"outgoing":["ef101d71722ee067"]}